      "text": "<math><mn>12</mn></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "o7PjV",
      "text": "<math><mn>16</mn></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given line passes through the focus&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, so it&nbsp;is a focal chord for the given parabola.</p><p>Hence, its slope is&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;the length of the intercept is the same as the length of the focal chord</p><p>Hence, the length of the intercept<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mtext>cosec</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
    "image": null
  },
